// Device-only: executes the two production file stores' android.system.Os calls in an
// app-private directory with deterministic faults. The injected identity/label matches the test
// APK only; system_server uid/label, physical power-cut, and real ENOSPC remain device evidence
// gates and are not claimed by this matrix.
